Third-party components
----------------------
Fovea bundles and depends on open-source components. Their notices are
retained with the application:

  - ONNX Runtime (Microsoft) — MIT license. Included as a statically-linked
    runtime; DirectML is used for GPU acceleration on any DirectX 12 adapter.
  - Real-ESRGAN models (`realesr-general-x4v3`, `realesr-general-wdn-x4v3`)
    — BSD 3-Clause. The full license text ships alongside the models in the
    application's `models` resources directory
    (`realesrgan-BSD-3-Clause.txt`).
  - Rust crates and npm packages under their respective licenses (MIT /
    Apache-2.0 / BSD / ISC), see `src-tauri/Cargo.toml` and `package.json`.

No grant is made to redistribute the Fovea application binary, its icons, or
its brand apart from this license.
